{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/CombatTitle.png?t=1747252209\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/Combat_Spring_2025.gif?t=1747252209\" />Command your Astrals in <strong>fast-paced, tactical battles.</strong> Queue abilities, adapt on the fly, and outplay your opponent in 1v1, 2v2, or full 3v3 team fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/AstralsTitle.png?t=1747252209\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/Astrals.gif?t=1747252209\" /><strong>Create and Customize Your Astrals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine elemental Aether to forge new creatures, each with unique strengths and forms. Mix, match, and <strong>master rare variants, and of course, shinies!</strong><br><br><strong>Master the Modular Skill System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip and reconfigure your Astrals\u2019 abilities with modular skill traits. Build precision combos, <strong>stack synergies,</strong> and tailor your team to any challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/DiscordJoinUs.png?t=1747252209\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2812890?t=1747252209","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2812890?t=1747252209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/8a01010e1388ba19ffe2425de80e54abf80acd08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747252209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com